 DCF_test;dir;t;a;b;n;o;r;d;c;x
⍝ DCF on its own small files in /tmp: describing, comparing, diffing, JSON.
 dir←'/tmp/dcf-test/'
 {}3 ⎕MKDIR dir
 {}{⎕NEXISTS ⍵:⎕NDELETE ⍵ ⋄ 0}¨dir∘,¨'a.dcf' 'b.dcf'

⍝ Kind
 'char vector'ExpectEq DCF.Kind'hello'
 'numeric matrix'ExpectEq DCF.Kind 2 3⍴⍳6
 'boolean vector'ExpectEq DCF.Kind 1 0 1
 'nested vector'ExpectEq DCF.Kind'ab' 'cd'
 'namespace'ExpectEq DCF.Kind ⎕NS''

⍝ Same: namespaces compare by content, not by reference
 a←⎕NS'' ⋄ a.(x y)←1 'two'
 b←⎕NS'' ⋄ b.(x y)←1 'two'
 1 ExpectEq a DCF.Same b
 b.y←'TWO'
 0 ExpectEq a DCF.Same b
 1 ExpectEq(1 a)DCF.Same(1 a)                           ⍝ inside arrays too

⍝ Safe: values ⎕JSON can't export become exportable
 o←⎕NS'' ⋄ o.v←0J1 ⋄ o.f←{⍵}
 x←DCF.JSON DCF.Safe o
 1 ExpectEq∨/'0J1'⍷x                                     ⍝ complex number as text
 1 ExpectEq∨/'apl_functions'⍷x                           ⍝ the function, by name

⍝ Two files: one record changed, one namespace field changed, one appended
 t←(dir,'a')⎕FCREATE 0
 {}(1 'Ann' 4000)⎕FAPPEND t
 o←⎕NS'' ⋄ o.(id status)←7 'open' ⋄ {}o ⎕FAPPEND t
 {}⎕FUNTIE t
 t←(dir,'b')⎕FCREATE 0
 {}(1 'Ann' 5000)⎕FAPPEND t
 o←⎕NS'' ⋄ o.(id status)←7 'paid' ⋄ {}o ⎕FAPPEND t
 {}(3 3⍴⍳9)⎕FAPPEND t
 {}⎕FUNTIE t

 r←DCF.DiffFiles(dir,'a')(dir,'b')
 0 2 1 0 ExpectEq r.(same changed added removed)
 c←r.components
 'items'ExpectEq c[1].detail.how
 3 ExpectEq c[1].detail.changes[1].at                     ⍝ [3] 4000 → 5000
 5000 ExpectEq c[1].detail.changes[1].new
 'fields'ExpectEq c[2].detail.how
 'status'ExpectEq c[2].detail.changes[1].field
 'paid'ExpectEq c[2].detail.changes[1].new
 'added'ExpectEq c[3].status

⍝ The report mentions every change, and a file equals itself in content
 x←∊DCF.Report r
 1 ExpectEq∨/'4000 → 5000'⍷x
 1 ExpectEq∨/'status: ''open'' → ''paid'''⍷x
 11 ExpectError'DCF.DiffFiles(dir,''a'')(dir,''a'')'        ⍝ same file: refused

⍝ Dump: every component, with metadata, and valid JSON
 d←DCF.Dump dir,'b'
 3 ExpectEq d.count
 'numeric matrix'ExpectEq d.components[3].kind
 1 ExpectEq 0<≢DCF.JSON d
